 * «Nuevo ítem» (ADR-0025 addendum 1). The page title, the admin's fixed
 * #page-actions bar («Atrás», «Siguiente») and the steps as section tabs; the
 * steps are drawn by `asset/js/wizard.js` from the configuration below, with
 * the copy translated here (NFR-005).
